              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka wa mirongo itanu wo ku ngoma ya Uziya umwami w'Abayuda, Pekahiya mwene Menahemu yimye muri Isirayeli i Samariya, amara imyaka ibiri ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko akora ibyangwa n'Uwiteka, ntiyareka ibyaha bya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati woheje Abisirayeli ngo bacumure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Peka mwene Remaliya umutware we aramugomera, amwicana na Arugobu na Ariyeha i Samariya, mu nzu y'igihome yo mu rugo rw'ibwami. Yari kumwe n'Abanyagaleyadi mirongo itanu, nuko amaze kumwica yima mu cyimbo cye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
